abraflexi-dark-gui (0.5.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Major update: Launcher script now enforces Adwaita:dark theme for improved visual experience.
  * Updated Debian dependencies to ensure compatibility with Adwaita theme and GNOME environments.
  * README.md revised to reflect current package name and usage instructions.
  * Application icon in .desktop file fixed for better desktop integration.
  * Comprehensive icon set generated for all standard resolutions using Inkscape.
  * Improved package structure for easier installation and maintenance.
  * Ensured compatibility with FlexiBee/AbraFlexi client and server packages.
  * Added support for latest Debian standards and best practices.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 27 Nov 2025 12:05:00 +0000

